// ==UserScript==
// @name         Argon Survey Guard v13.5 (Access Control + Quiet Mode)
// @namespace    http://tampermonkey.net/
// !!! NEVER CHANGE @name OR @namespace AGAIN. Tampermonkey ties the saved data (Access ID, name, locks) to them.
// !!! A new @name = a NEW script = NEW Access ID + empty storage. Only change @version.
// @version      16.53
// @updateURL    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rohimgpt/argon-list/main/argon.user.js
// @downloadURL  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rohimgpt/argon-list/main/argon.user.js
// @description  v16.53: topic hosts (Upside, ShopperMX, nsv.netr.jp, UserTesting participant) capture more topic phrases (up to 10 keys, 16 phrases per page). v16.52: profile questions AND their answer options (age, income, gender, employment, education, race, countries/states) are stripped from the page text before topic detection, in all surveys (Upside / ShopperMX first pages no longer become the topic). v16.51: host-scoped keywords ("surveymonkey.com::consumer") block only on that domain, when the word is in the first 4 pages of the survey. v16.49: location questions ("In which state or territory?") and their answers (countries / UK nations / states) are profile questions and never become the topic. Locks a completed survey for 7/15/30 days, tracks real start-to-end time, merge-able backups, admin-controlled remote blocklist (domains / keywords / logo images, also checked inside page links, headers, titles & logos), and an approval system (Pending / Allowed / Blocked access IDs). v16.48: UserTesting completed only via Lootwalls status=completed. v16.47: UserTesting one-page surveys are completed through Lootwalls status=completed (no thank-you text rule). v16.45: participant.use2.usertesting.com is a topic host (like ShopperMX). v16.44: UserTesting qualify page is not completed; nsv.netr.jp topic host. v16.43: better topic detection (brand names, purchase phrases, platform words ignored, word-order/plural-proof keys on Upside+ShopperMX). v16.42: Upside=start.dig.one, ShopperMX=incontext.decipherinc.com, link/id ignored, topic required. v16.41: Upside+ShopperMX strict topic matching (per-survey ratio, generic keys ignored). v16.40: topic from first 4 non-profile pages (all surveys), topic-first repeat check, 1-page surveys. v16.39: Upside topic. v16.38: repeat detected by topic when the link/id changes. v16.37: sheet has survey links only (no Lootwalls / UT screener rows). v16.36: CSV hides apiKey/userId. v16.35: UserTesting screener/legal steps no longer logged as completed. v16.34: strict-keyword and storage-lock fixes. v16.12: fixed scan crash (null.startsWith) that stopped NEW-survey alerts; admin block screen now replaces the whole page so the red screen always shows.
// @match        *://*/*
// @noframes
// @grant        GM_setValue
// @grant        GM_getValue
// @grant        GM_getTab
// @grant        GM_saveTab
// @grant        GM_registerMenuCommand
// @grant        GM_unregisterMenuCommand
// @grant        GM_notification
// @grant        GM_xmlhttpRequest
// @grant        GM_openInTab
// @connect      raw.githubusercontent.com
// @connect      api.github.com
// @connect      argon-track.mdsam7997.workers.dev
// @connect      *
// @run-at       document-start
// ==/UserScript==
